sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant I as Interviewer
    participant C as Candidate
    participant Mental as Mental model
    I->>C: what happens when you run this command?
    C->>Mental: which layer does this touch — syscall, kernel, hardware?
    Mental-->>C: the path from user space down
    C->>I: walk it down one layer at a time
    I->>C: and if it hangs?
    C->>Mental: which state is the process in, and what is it waiting on?
    Mental-->>C: runnable, sleeping, or uninterruptible
    C->>I: name the tool that would show it
    Note over C,Mental: a good answer names the mechanism and the instrument that proves it
    I->>C: why is it built that way?
    C->>I: the trade-off the kernel chose, and what it costs
